g.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nortale%27s_Hostel\" title=\"Nortale's Hostel\">Nortale's Hostel</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;90&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-61</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Employment Opportunities THIS TENDAY so act now!<br><br>\n</p><p>Fish Cleaner Wanted - apply to Old Troutman at the Heapside Docks<br><br>\n</p><p>Cut Hair Sweeper, must bring own broom - Figaro Facemaker<br><br>\n</p><p>Drummer Needed (for pickup band) - See Henk at the Singing Lute\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214521\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1348/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 15361/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4209/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 818194/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.575      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   34.575      1 -total\n 38.07%   13.161      6 Template:Icon_text\n 30.47%   10.535     13 Template:Trim\n 20.01%    6